                                "sense_id": "97461d69-857a-35ba-9ea0-222dc141628b",
                                "text": "According to the provisions of the \"renewed land order,\" which was finally issued in 1627 for Bohemia, and in the following year for Moravia, the two countries became hereditary Habsburg territories like the Austrian archduchies."
